# Electronic-Hands (op//002)

This repo is the **kit + agent pack** for hack//ops op//002. Demos are in person.
There is no team submission archive here.

Before writing firmware, SDK code, or wiring advice:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/safety.md`.
2. Identify the kit: Reachy Mini, SO-ARM101, Arduino + sensors, or CrowPanel Advance.
3. Read `docs/kits/<kit>.md` and `.cursor/skills/<kit>/SKILL.md`.
4. Prefer official upstream docs linked from the kit page. Do not invent APIs,
   pinouts, motor voltages, or Arduino core versions.
5. Do not commit secrets. Do not reflash shared kits without confirmation.
6. First milestone: one physical hello-world on real hardware.
